<title>USA: North European Oil Royalty Q4 net down.</title>
<headline>North European Oil Royalty Q4 net down.</headline>
<dateline>RED BANK, N.J. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>NORTH EUROPEAN OIL ROYALTY TRUST</p>
<p> Quarter Ended		     Oct 31, 1996	Oct 31, 1995</p>
<p> German Royalties Received	 $2,553,539	  $3,027,012</p>
<p> Net Income			     2,438,664	   2,922,458</p>
<p> Net Income Per Unit			  .28		   .35</p>
<p> Fiscal Year Ended		 Oct 31, 1996	Oct 31, 1995</p>
<p> German Royalties Received	  9,710,487	  12,477,788</p>
<p> Net Income			     9,086,316	  11,941,675</p>
<p> Net Income Per Unit			 1.05		  1.43</p>
<p>The Trust declared a distribution to owners of 27 cents per unit for the fourth fiscal quarter, making the total distribution for the 1996 fiscal year $1.04 per unit compared to $1.43 for the prior year. The distribution will be paid on November 20, 1996 to holders of record on November 9, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
